OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F377A1786623510
OL,3,CUK's largest Harry Potter shop to open
OL,4,Cin central London
OL,6,FThe UK's largest Harry Potter shop is
OL,7,Fto open in London's Oxford Street in
OL,8,FNovember, Warner Bros has announced.
OL,10,FThe flagship store, spanning more than
OL,11,F21,000 square feet over two floors,
OL,12,Fwill open its doors within The Ribbon
OL,13,Fdevelopment at 134-140 Oxford Street
OL,14,Fon November 4.
OL,16,FInspired by the magical shopping
OL,17,Fstreet Diagon Alley, the new shop will
OL,18,Fbecome the second official Harry
OL,19,FPotter retail destination in the UK
OL,20,Fafter a site at King's Cross Station.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/5
