PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F377A1786623510
OL,3,CUK's largest Harry Potter shop to open
OL,4,Cin central London
OL,6,FWarner Bros said the destination will
OL,7,Fboast themed spaces designed to
OL,8,Fimmerse fans in Harry Potter's
OL,9,Fwizarding world, with attractions
OL,10,Fincluding a Ukrainian Ironbelly Dragon
OL,11,Ftowering over the Gringotts area of
OL,12,Fthe store, a full-sized Knight Bus,
OL,13,Fand The Leaky Cauldron wizarding pub
OL,14,Fwhere visitors will have the
OL,15,Fopportunity to enjoy food and
OL,16,FButterbeer drinks.
OL,18,FWarner Bros has released official
OL,19,Fconcept artwork for the shop, offering
OL,20,Ffans a first glimpse of the
OL,21,Fdestination ahead of its opening.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/5
