CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F377A1786623510
OL,3,CUK's largest Harry Potter shop to open
OL,4,Cin central London
OL,6,FKarl Durrant, Warner Bros senior vice
OL,7,Fpresident of worldwide retail, said:
OL,8,F"Following the success of our Harry
OL,9,FPotter shops around the globe, opening
OL,10,Fthe Harry Potter Shop in London is a
OL,11,Ftruly special milestone.
OL,13,F"We're incredibly proud to bring the
OL,14,Fmagic back to the city where Harry
OL,15,FPotter's story began.
OL,17,F"There's no better place to create a
OL,18,Fdestination that celebrates the magic,
OL,19,Fcreativity and storytelling that has
OL,20,Fcaptivated generations of fans around
OL,21,Fthe world.
OL,26,@pD@AOUuD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/5
