PN,37704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F377A1786623510
OL,3,CUK's largest Harry Potter shop to open
OL,4,Cin central London
OL,6,F"Step inside and you'll feel as though
OL,7,Fyou've walked straight into Diagon
OL,8,FAlley.
OL,10,F"Every detail has been designed to
OL,11,Ftransport fans into the wizarding
OL,12,Fworld. Whether you're local to London
OL,13,For visiting from afar, we can't wait
OL,14,Fto welcome fans through our doors this
OL,15,FNovember."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUwD@JO]
