CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F377A1786623510
OL,3,CUK's largest Harry Potter shop to open
OL,4,Cin central London
OL,6,FThe shop will join the collection of
OL,7,FHarry Potter experiences owned and
OL,8,Foperated by Warner Bros in London
OL,9,Fincluding Warner Bros Studio Tour
OL,10,FLondon`The Making of Harry Potter and
OL,11,Fthe Harry Potter shop at King's Cross.
OL,13,FOxford Street is one of the world's
OL,14,Fbusiest shopping areas, with around
OL,15,Fhalf a million visitors each day.
